{"parse": {"title": "冷铁-08", "pageid": 119639, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E9%93%81-07\" title=\"冷铁-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冷铁-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冷铁</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.B1.BC.E8.82.9A.E7.99.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"鱼肚白\">鱼肚白</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 鱼肚白</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A New Dawn</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-638013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-638013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-638013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>但那终究是美梦。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>和政府和谈？与他们一起接受分割领土的条约？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前老人和善的面目是如此可憎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯帕塞将军：</div><div>伊格丽卡，这是最好的结果……政治不如你想得这么简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>“实现奥雷诺西亚自治”，这难道不是色雷斯解放阵线的精神吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯帕塞将军：</div><div>我们至今仍旧没有放弃这个精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>没有放弃这个精神的只有你的嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯帕塞将军：</div><div>我们的理想足够伟大，所以不可能一步登天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯帕塞将军：</div><div>这只是缓兵之计，只有先签署条约，我们才可能获得更多的援助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>这又是什么道理？几年前那三名士兵受的冤屈洗清了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯帕塞将军：</div><div>你瞧瞧这是什么话，案宗都在档案室放着呢，你要是真的关心过的话自然可以查到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊格丽卡被斯帕塞将军的语言艺术噎住了，随后一股怒火从胸膛升起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>我不会同意的，我的队员也不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/HeadIconSmall-505901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯帕塞将军：</div><div>年轻人，你要为自己说的话负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和善从老人的脸上消失了，但伊格丽卡不在乎，她正大光明地直视着老人冷漠的眼神，靠向老人，随后耳语着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>我们已经在造反了，难道你还怕我造你的反不成？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>言罢，她便头也不回地离开了那个令人作呕的地方。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“羊倌”：</div><div>队、队长……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“羊倌”抱着几摞信件跑进了伊格丽卡的办公室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>有回信了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊格丽卡捞过“羊倌”怀里的信件，一封一封地拆开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每打开一封，她的脸色便又低沉一分。直到最后，一摞信中仅剩了几封还留在桌面上，剩下的都被愤怒的伊格丽卡用指尖烧掉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-638014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-638014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-638014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>我在边境待得太久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-638012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-638012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-638012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>原来我们的组织是在利益的编织中前进的，每一步的实施都离不开它背后的交易……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊格丽卡疲惫地靠在椅背上，用手指揉了揉额头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-638014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-638014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-638014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>他们早就联合各方的势力，把奥雷诺西亚吃干抹净了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“羊倌”：</div><div>那现在——在要怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊格丽卡向后瘫着，使椅子的两只前脚翘起，她就在这“吱呀”的摇晃中感受着走钢丝一般的危险感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>帮我联系到这几个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指着桌子上仅剩的几封信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>然后……我要开个动员大会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“羊倌”：</div><div>好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但就在“羊倌”准备离开伊格丽卡办公室时，勤务兵将另一封信件送了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“羊倌”：</div><div>还有一封信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>放那里吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“羊倌”：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“羊倌”将信放在伊格丽卡办公桌上后就离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊格丽卡有些怀疑地看着这封新送来的信件，因为在她的印象中，她已经收到了全部的回信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>这封信又会是谁的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但凝视是无用的，伊格丽卡将信封从桌子上拿了起来，用拆信刀将它打开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-638001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>快跑</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_gaosiniao\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_gaosiniao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_gaosiniao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>呃啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳边尽是燃烧的声音，而伊格丽卡已经感受不到肢体的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她尝试挥动着自己的肢体，却发现自己的一条手臂已然被炸断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>**……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忍着剧痛，她在火焰中爬行着找回断肢，用自己的神秘术将它缝合回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>太天真了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>不论是手段还是志向……都太天真了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>用手掌擦下满脸血迹，指腹感受到了血肉外翻的触感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在火焰中用自己的神秘术一点一点地修复着自己的躯体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像当初一名一名地找回被打散的游击队员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>你以为除掉我就没有人能站出来撕裂你们贪欲横流的嘴脸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>你以为杀鸡儆猴便能让有志之士噤声……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>你方法选错了……火焰……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊格丽卡：</div><div>火焰是杀不死我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">三年后</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火车飞驰于茫茫雪原中，但车厢内温馨明亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>告死鸟将手背贴在车厢的玻璃上，感受着这层有着隔阂的寒冷。在她对面，坐着获得了政府授勋的列车长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>女士，我说得没错吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>您在那场爆炸中活了下来，并为了逃亡而隐姓埋名，更名为告死鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他合上了一本厚厚的资料册，将它放在面前的小桌子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>资料册发出了一声敦厚的声响，可见其中内容之多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>您都说对了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>告死鸟看了看列车长，随后继续着手上的刺绣工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>鉴于您有革命军的背景，火车到达下一站时，您和您瞒着我挂上的难民车厢都会交由政府处理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>以及您当初入职维也纳-潘诺尼亚运输公司时的推荐人，也被视为与革命军有牵连的嫌疑人，我们将一并调查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>这是公司要求的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>公司吗？他们还不知道这件事，</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长站起身来，他身上的银色勋章在烛火的照映下闪闪发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>勋章挺好看的，价格是“一车难民”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>最主要的还是你。看好她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他一边吩咐着乘警，一边向车厢外走着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但列车长没能成行，告死鸟的声音拉扯住了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>列车长，你知道现在火车在往哪里开吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>告死鸟似乎是缝完了最后一针，她用牙齿轻轻地咬断了线头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>列车长疑惑地看着告死鸟，她手中白色的麻布上，一枚鲜红的刺绣图样令他分外眼熟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>我和我的难民们不会被交到政府的手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门口的两位乘警向列车长转过身去，列车长在他们的衣领内找到了眼熟的根源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列车长：</div><div>你……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在被逮捕的最后一刻，透过车厢门的玻璃，列车长看到整车的乘务员都整齐地站到了车厢的过道中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>告死鸟走到车厢尾部的窗户旁，远方泛起了一丝鱼肚白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>不管落下去多少次，太阳总会再次升起来的，天要亮了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>队长，我会把地图缝合成我们心目中的那个样子。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冷铁-08"}}